                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>Credit Risk &amp; Loan Default Analysis  ·  Decision and Recommendations</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d7dee8' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>
What should happen next, who owns it, and how progress will be measured</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
