              <zone h='11023' id='3' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='10181'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  P1 actions target grade D, grade C expected-loss dollars, and term/purpose pricing.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;EVIDENCE</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  The recommendation matrix links evidence, owner and metric for each action.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;BUSINESS MEANING</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Management can move from finding to owner to KPI.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;RECOMMENDED ACTION</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Assign owners and track Expected Loss % and Default Rate.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-color-left' value='#2f5d8a' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-style-left' value='solid' />
